{"unit_id":"godlike985__dsh-sidebar-editor#card-zh","repo":"godlike985/dsh-sidebar-editor","commit":"82882fffa9b919a0fd078e39945af26046b7e5bc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-editor 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的侧栏代码预览与引用工具。它为常见代码文件注册右侧文档预览，并提供工作区文件名搜索、文件树定位、行范围选择以及将文件或选中行插入对话输入框的操作。用户可从文件树或搜索结果打开文件，在预览中选择代码行供对话引用；还可使用文件内查找和快捷键打开搜索。适合需要在 DSH 会话中查阅项目代码并把相关位置交给 agent 的开发场景。当前应用默认提供只读预览；编辑和保存界面默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2675-2695","client.js:2734-2757"]}
{"unit_id":"godlike985__dsh-sidebar-editor#card-en","repo":"godlike985/dsh-sidebar-editor","commit":"82882fffa9b919a0fd078e39945af26046b7e5bc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-editor brings code preview and workspace search to the DSH Web sidebar. Users can open files, find them by name, select lines, and insert file or range references into a conversation. It helps developers share project context in a DSH session. The app defaults to read-only preview.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2675-2695","client.js:2734-2757"]}
